# Public API (pe:*)
  @api pe:open(body, commit, poly)  @ 225-284
      @contract  mint a checkout take on scratch, materialise `body`, bind the mini tm; `commit(newBody)` is the write-back  @ 222
      @contract  snapshots the body and arms write-through once materialised (open/close rebuilds stay silent)  @ 223
      @contract  an empty body (no lengthPpq) defaults its loop to one bar of the checkout take  @ 224
  @api pe:close()  @ 288-297
      @contract  sweep the pool metadata (write-through, so leaks without this)  @ 286
      @contract  unbind the mini tm, delete the checkout item  @ 287
  @api pe:isOpen()  @ 299
  @api pe:currentTake()  @ 300
  @api pe:draw()  @ 408-449
      @contract  draw pass -- toolbar row, grid fills the region below; popup sizes to fit  @ 407
  @api pe:handleInput(close)  @ 453-479
      @contract  input pass -- mouse, dispatch against mini cmgr, note entry; unconsumed Esc cancels, Enter commits  @ 451
      @contract  returns the dispatch result kr = { consumed, commandHeld }  @ 452
  @api pe:launch(body, commit, poly)  @ 487-513
      @contract  production entry -- mint the checkout on `body` and raise the editing modal; onClose sweeps it  @ 486

